#. <CLT 4>ゴミ捨て場を抜けた先は、
#. トンネルが縦に伸びる煙突状の空間になっていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After leaving the garbage pit, we found ourselves in a\n"
"tunnel extending straight up, like a chimney.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その壁面には、鉄製のハシゴ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was a metal ladder leading up into the tunnel.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは地上を目指し、
#. そのハシゴをのぼっていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We started climbing the ladder, intent on reaching the\n"
"surface.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>長い長いハシゴだった。
#. 天井がまるで見えない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The ladder was impossibly long; I couldn't even see\n"
"where it ended.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、しばらくすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We climbed into darkness...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>足元も見えなくなった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The passage was so dark and cramped, I couldn't even\n"
"see my own feet beneath me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あのゴミ捨て場って…
#. そんなに深いに場所にあったんだね…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I had no idea we were so far down..."
msgstr ""

#. 足を踏み外さないでよ。
#. あなたが落ちて来ても、受け止められないから…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Don't lose your footing. If you slip, I won't be able\n"
"to catch you..."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…気を付けるよ……
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I'll be careful..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とは言ったものの、意識し始めると逆に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now that you said that, I'm getting kind of\n"
"nervous...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何か話でもして…
#. 気を紛らわせた方がいいかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe talking will help keep my mind off it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのさ、霧切さん…
#. 聞きたい事があるんだけど…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, so Kyoko...there's something I wanted to ask you."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんは<CLT 3>“超高校級の探偵”<CLT>なんだよね？
#. いつから、探偵をやってるの…？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You said you're the <CLT 3>Ultimate Detective<CLT>, right? So\n"
"how long have you been doing detective work?"
msgstr ""

#. …いつから？
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "How long...?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの、ずっとよ…
#. 幼い頃からずっと…
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Ever since I can remember."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切家は代々、
#. 探偵を生業としてきた一族なの。
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I come from a long line of detectives. Detective work\n"
"is in my blood."
msgstr ""

#. 探偵が今よりも神聖な職業だった頃からね。
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There was a time when being a detective was considered\n"
"a sacred duty. My family's always seen it that way."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、霧切さんの家って…
#. 有名だったりするの？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...is your family famous?"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ…むしろ逆よ…
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Quite the opposite, actually."
msgstr ""

#. 同じ業種の人間でも、ほとんどが知らないはずよ。
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Even among actual detectives, many people haven't\n"
"heard of us."
msgstr ""

#. え？　どうして？
#. そんな伝統ある家系なのに…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Huh? But...how come? It's like your family tradition,\n"
"right? So..."
msgstr ""

#. それが、私達一族の誇りだから…
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because we take pride in it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…誇り？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Pride...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 探偵は…光でも影でもない…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "A detective is neither light nor shadow."
msgstr ""

#. 正義でも悪でもないからこそ、
#. 唯一の真実を手に入れられる…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We represent neither justice nor evil. That is how we\n"
"can uncover the absolute truth."
msgstr ""

#. 私達が立つ場所は常に中立であるべき…
#. その為には、世俗とも一線を画さなければならない。
msgctxt "0027 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We stand neutral in all things. And to do that, we\n"
"have to stand separate from the rest of society."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、私達はあえて、
#. 自分達の存在を隠しているのよ…
msgctxt "0028 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Which is why we've made a conscious effort to conceal\n"
"our existence."
msgstr ""

#. あえて…隠してる…？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A conscious effort...?"
msgstr ""

#. 古臭いし、合理的な考えとは言えないわね…
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's kind of old-fashioned, and I can't say it's\n"
"entirely rational..."
msgstr ""

#. それでも、私達はその考えを守るわ。
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But it's our family creed, and we do what we must to\n"
"protect it."
msgstr ""

#. だって…それが誇りってものでしょう？
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because, like I said, it's our source of pride."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誇り…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Pride...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうか…それが理由だったのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that explains...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>入学前に“希望ヶ峰学園新入生スレ”を覗いた時、
#. 霧切さんの素性が、明らかにならなかったのも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before I came here, when was looking up info about the\n"
"school online, I never saw anything about her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一族の誇りを守る為に…あえて隠していたから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because she hid herself on purpose, to protect the\n"
"pride of her family...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、私は…
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And yet..."
msgstr "Thế nhưng..."

#. 私は…その誇りを曲げてしまった…
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I...gave up some of that pride."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. 私は、この希望ヶ峰学園に入学する為に、
#. 学園側に自分を売り込んだの…
msgctxt "0040 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In order to enter Hope's Peak, I had to reveal myself\n"
"to the school."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切家の探偵として、
#. あるまじき行為と知りつつね…
msgctxt "0041 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I did it knowing it was something a true Kirigiri\n"
"detective would never do."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大事な誇りを曲げた…
#. 霧切さんが、そこまでした理由って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the reason you gave up that pride...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこまでして、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に入学したかった理由って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason you would go so far to enter Hope's Peak...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それだけ、お父さんと会うのが楽しみだったんだよね？
#. だったら…仕方がないよ…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It was because that's how much you wanted to reconnect\n"
"with your dad, right? There's no shame in that."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …楽しみ？
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Reconnect...?"
msgstr ""

#. 父との再会が楽しみだなんて…
#. そんな訳ないじゃない…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I had absolutely no desire to reconnect with my\n"
"father."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. だ、だって…お父さんとは久しぶりに会うんでしょ？
#. 話したい事だって色々あるはずじゃ…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But...you'd be reuniting after all those years,\n"
"right? You would've had so much to talk about..."
msgstr ""

#. 話したい事なんてないわ…
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "There's nothing I want to talk to my father about."
msgstr ""

#. …言いたい事ならあるけどね。
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "There is something I want to *say* to him, though."
msgstr ""

#. い、言いたい事…？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、あの人にどうしても言いたい事があるの。
#. 直接会って、言いたい事がね…
msgctxt "0053 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No matter what it takes, I have to find him and tell\n"
"him, face to face..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それって…？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. 絶縁の言葉よ…
msgctxt "0055 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I want to sever all ties with him."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ぜ、絶縁…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sever...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私が、あの人と最後に会ったのは…
msgctxt "0057 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The last time I saw him..."
msgstr ""

#. まだ…私が幼い頃だったわ…
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...I was still very young."
msgstr ""

#. だから、詳しくは知らないけど、
#. あの人は頭のいい人だったらしいわ…
msgctxt "0059 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So I don't remember myself, but apparently he was\n"
"extremely intelligent."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切家の次代当主として、
#. 将来を有望される逸材だったみたい…
msgctxt "0060 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He was in line to become the next head of the Kirigiri\n"
"family. He was talented, he had a promising future."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、彼は探偵という職業を嫌っていた。
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But he had no interest in detective work."
msgstr ""

#. だから、霧切家から落ちこぼれた…
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So he cut himself off from the family."
msgstr ""

#. そして、あの人は、私の母の死をきっかけに、
#. 家を飛び出していったのよ。
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Not long after that, my mother died, and he\n"
"simply...ran away."
msgstr ""

#. 当主である祖父との大喧嘩の末に…
#. 幼かった私だけを置いてね…
msgctxt "0064 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He went to my grandfather, and they had a huge\n"
"argument. And young as I was...he left me behind."
msgstr ""

#. き、きっと…何か理由があったんだよ…
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I'm sure there was a reason for that."
msgstr ""

#. お父さんだって本当は…
#. 霧切さんを連れて行きたかったと思うよ…
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm sure your dad wanted to take you with him."
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、彼に感謝しないとね。
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If that's true, then I need to thank him."
msgstr ""

#. 置いていってくれて、ありがとうって…
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Thank him for leaving me..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、私はあの人と違って、
#. 探偵という仕事に<CLT 3>“誇り”<CLT>を持っているから…
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because unlike him, I take <CLT 3>pride<CLT> in the work I do."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切家に<CLT 3>“誇り”<CLT>を持っているから…
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I take <CLT 3>pride<CLT> in my family name."
msgstr ""

#. だから、私は連れて行かれなくて、
#. 心底良かったと思っているわ…
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So every last part of me is happy he didn't take me\n"
"with him."
msgstr ""

#. 万が一、あの人に連れて行かれてたら、
#. 私は探偵にはなれなかったはずだもの…
msgctxt "0072 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If I'd gone with him, I never would have had the\n"
"chance to become a detective."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>先に、ハシゴをのぼるボクからは、
#. 霧切さんの表情を見る事は出来なかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was above Kyoko on the ladder, so I wasn't able to\n"
"see her expression.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、霧切さんがどんな顔で…
#. どんな気持ちで、今の言葉を言ったのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I couldn't tell...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクにはわからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't see how she looked when she said that,\n"
"what she might have been feeling.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ、その時の霧切さんは、
#. いつもと比べると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All I could tell was that compared to her usual\n"
"self...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…口数も多くて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...she was more talkative.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…ムキになっているような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And more emotional.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、あの人を責める気はない。
#. 彼には彼の人生があるんだし…
msgctxt "0079 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't blame him, you know. He had his own life to\n"
"live."
msgstr ""

#. 他人事…そう思われるかもしれないけど…
#. でも、実際そうなのよ…
msgctxt "0080 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's what anyone in my position might say, right?\n"
"But it's not true..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…１つだけ……
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But there's one thing..."
msgstr ""

#. １つだけ…どうしても許せない事があるの…
msgctxt "0082 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "One thing that I can never forgive."
msgstr ""

#. 許せない…事…？
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. 周囲の私を見る目…
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The way everyone else looked at me."
msgstr ""

#. 私は自分が置いていかれた事を悲しんでいない…
#. むしろ、それで良かったと思ってる…
msgctxt "0085 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I was never sad about being left behind. Like I said,\n"
"I think it was a good thing."
msgstr ""

#. でも、周囲の見る目は違うわ…
msgctxt "0086 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But when the rest of my family looked at me, they saw\n"
"something different."
msgstr ""

#. 私はずっと、<CLT 3>“父に捨てられた子”<CLT>と
#. 思われ続けてきた。
msgctxt "0087 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They only saw me as <CLT 3>the little girl that was\n"
"abandoned by her father<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そういう目で、見られ続けてきた…
msgctxt "0088 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's how they see me even to this day."
msgstr ""

#. もう、いい加減うんざりなのよ…
#. 過去に…あの人の影に…付きまとわれるのは…
msgctxt "0089 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"His shadow has been following me my entire life. I'm\n"
"sick of it."
msgstr ""

#. そろそろ切り離したいの…
#. 私の人生から…あの人を…
msgctxt "0090 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I need him out of my life. I need to step out of his\n"
"shadow."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、私から言わなくちゃいけない。
#. 彼に…絶縁の言葉をね…
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's why I have to find him, and tell him we're no\n"
"longer family."
msgstr ""

#. 過去を清算する為に…
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "In order to settle the past..."
msgstr ""

#. 私の人生から、彼を切り離す為に…
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "In order to remove him from my life forever..."
msgstr ""

#. もっとも、向こうは私の事なんて、
#. とっくに忘れているでしょうけどね…
msgctxt "0094 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I have no doubt he forgot about me years ago."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…家族なのに……
#. そんな…絶縁なんて…
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But...you're family. To just cut him out like\n"
"that..."
msgstr ""

#. 私と彼は血が繋がってるだけ。
#. ただ、それだけよ。
msgctxt "0096 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Our only connection is through blood, nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. 血が繋がっているだけで、
#. 心は繋がっていない…
msgctxt "0097 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Are we connected by heart and soul? No."
msgstr ""

#. そんな関係を、家族と呼べるのかしら？
msgctxt "0098 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Is blood really enough to call someone family?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>血が繋がっているだけ…
#. 心は繋がっていない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Only connected by blood, not by heart or soul...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言い切った霧切さんに返す言葉は、
#. どこにも見当たらなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was so shocked to hear her say something like that,\n"
"I didn't know how to respond.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、ボクは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So instead...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、口を閉ざすしかなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I said nothing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無言のまま、ハシゴをのぼり続けた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just kept climbing the ladder in complete silence.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、しばらくしたところで、
#. ようやく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And after I don't know how long...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクらは辿り着いた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...we finally reached the top.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここで終わりみたいだね…
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Looks like this is it."
msgstr ""

#. その扉の向こうが…希望ヶ峰学園よ。
msgctxt "0107 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"On the other side of this door...Hope's Peak is\n"
"waiting for us."
msgstr ""

#. 戻って…来たんだね…
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "We're...back."
msgstr ""

#. 寄宿舎のトラッシュルームの床に、
#. 扉があったでしょう？
msgctxt "0109 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Remember that hatch on the ground near the trash room?"
msgstr ""

#. …あそこに繋がってるはずよ。
msgctxt "0110 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm fairly certain that's where we'll come out."
msgstr ""

#. 前もって鍵は外しておいたから、
#. 問題なく開くはずだけど…
msgctxt "0111 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I unlocked it earlier, so it should open without much\n"
"trouble."
msgstr ""

#. やってみるね…
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, here goes nothin'..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>頭上の扉に右手を添え、力を込めると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I reached my right hand up and pushed against the\n"
"hatch.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>扉はすんなりと持ち上がった。
#. そして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The hatch opened with ease. And so...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 戻って…来たんだね…
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Looks like we're back..."
msgstr ""

#. まったく長いハシゴだったわね…
#. お陰で、クタクタよ…
msgctxt "0116 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But I can't believe how long that ladder was. I'm\n"
"exhausted..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無事に…と言えるかどうかはさておき、
#. ボク達はなんとか帰って来たようだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't exactly say we're safe and sound, but...at\n"
"least we're out of there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この希望ヶ峰学園に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now we're back in Hope's Peak Academy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん、ありがとう…
#. お陰で助かったよ…
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Kyoko...thank you. I never would've gotten out of\n"
"there without you."
msgstr ""

#. …礼なんていらないわ。
#. 私は借りを返しただけだから。
msgctxt "0120 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No thanks necessary. I was just returning the favor."
msgstr ""

#. だけどさ…これからどうしたらいいのかな？
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...now what do we do?"
msgstr ""

#. 処刑から逃げて来たのはいいけど、
#. もし、黒幕に見つかったりしたら…
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I didn't die, of course, but if the\n"
"mastermind finds out..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクだけじゃなくて、
#. ボクを助けた霧切さんにまで危険が及ぶ可能性だって…
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And I'm worried about you, too. You helped me, so they\n"
"might..."
msgstr ""

#. …心配？
msgctxt "0124 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You're worried?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そりゃ…そうだよ……
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, of course."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、
#. 直接、確認してみましょうか？
msgctxt "0126 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then let's just get a concrete answer."
msgstr ""

#. …え？　直接って…？
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. モノクマに聞いてみるのよ。
#. あなたが逃げたのがマズイのかどうか…
msgctxt "0128 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Let's ask Monokuma if there's a problem with you\n"
"escaping."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなの…！
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "W-Wait, that's—!"
msgstr ""

#. どうせ、隠れてても見つかるのは時間の問題よ。
#. 逃げ場なんてどこにもないんだし…
msgctxt "0130 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If we try to hide, it's only a matter of time till\n"
"we're found out. And it's not like we can run away."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って、霧切さんは監視カメラを指差した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As she said that, she pointed at the nearby\n"
"surveillance camera.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …捕まるのを待つくらいなら…
#. 自首した方が気が楽になるって事…？
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So you're saying rather than stressing out over\n"
"getting caught, we should just give up now?"
msgstr ""

#. …大丈夫よ。
#. あなたが心配しているような事にはならないわ…
msgctxt "0133 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Don't worry. What you think is going to happen, isn't."
msgstr ""

#. だって、追い詰められているのは、
#. 黒幕の方なんだから…
msgctxt "0134 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because the mastermind is the one that's ensnared."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>追い詰められてるのは…黒幕の方って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind is ensnared...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それって、前にも言ってたけどさ…
#. どういう意味なの？
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You said something like that before. What does it\n"
"mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. あの戦刃むくろの学級裁判で、
#. 黒幕は自ら露呈してしまったのよ。
msgctxt "0137 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind stood exposed during the investigation\n"
"into Mukuro's death."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕自身の…つけ入る隙をね…
msgctxt "0138 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There was a moment where the mastermind let their\n"
"guard down."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕の…つけ入る隙…？
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There was...?"
msgstr ""

#. 実際に、モノクマと話してみればわかるわ。
msgctxt "0140 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If we can talk to Monokuma, we can confirm it."
msgstr ""

#. それに、向こうに見つかるより先に、
#. こちらから行った方が得策よ。
msgctxt "0141 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And it'll be better for us if we go to him directly\n"
"before he tracks us down."
msgstr ""

#. 交渉を有利に進める為にもね…
msgctxt "0142 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That should help with our negotiations..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ちょっと…
#. いや、かなり不安だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm still a little—no, super uneasy about this.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 行くしか…ないんだよね…？
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...we don't really have a choice, do we?"
msgstr ""

#. 体育館よ…
#. モノクマはそこにいるはず…
msgctxt "0146 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Monokuma should be in the gym."
msgstr ""

#. …行きましょうか。
msgctxt "0147 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr ""

#. 体育館へ行きましょう…
#. モノクマはそこにいるはずよ…
msgctxt "0148 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Let's head to the gym. Monokuma should be there."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. もう見たくない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"don't wanna look at it anymore...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. もしかして、今もこの向こうで黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0150 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... Is the mastermind watching us\n"
"even now...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これから…どうしたらいいだろう？
#. 霧切さんに相談するか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What should we do now? Maybe I should talk with\n"
"Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0152 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0153 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0154 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここはトラッシュルーム…つまりゴミ捨て場だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0155 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the trash room. The dump, in other words.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là phòng chứa rác. Nói cách khác là bãi rác.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>でも掃除当番がゴミを捨ててるとこなんて
#. 見た事がないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0156 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But to be honest, I don't think I've seen anyone throw\n"
"anything away down here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鉄格子の開閉スイッチだ…
#. ボクは鍵を持ってないから、開けられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0157 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the switch that raises and lowers the gate. I\n"
"don't have the key to open it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも、掃除当番って設定はどうなったんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We never did set up that cleaning duty rotation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクたちが出て来た扉だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is how we got out of the garbage pit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まさか、ここが
#. 地下のゴミ捨て場に通じていたなんてな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I never would have imagined *that's* where this led...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出て…どうしたらいいんだろう？
#. 霧切さんに相談するか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So what's the next step once we get out of here? I\n"
"should ask Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0162 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0163 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0164 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
